# Git remote for saac

When pushing, pulling, or setting upstream for this repo, use **only** Pourfex/saac:

- Preferred remote name: `github` → `git@github.com:Pourfex/saac.git`
- HTTPS equivalent (if SSH key fails): `https://github.com/Pourfex/saac.git`
- Do **not** use `origin` (`git@github.com:SaacPSI/saac.git`) unless the user explicitly asks

```bash
# ✅ GOOD
git push github HEAD
git push -u github HEAD
git push https://github.com/Pourfex/saac.git HEAD:<branch>

# ❌ BAD
git push origin HEAD
git push -u origin HEAD
```

- Do not change `git remote` URLs or add remotes unless the user asks.
- PRs/issues for this work: `--repo Pourfex/saac`.
